              </div>`).join('')}
          </div>`).join('')}
      </div>

      <div class="report-footer">
        <div class="report-footer-disclaimer">
          This report is generated by CyberPro Gauge and constitutes a baseline self-assessment only.
          It does not represent a formal cybersecurity audit, penetration test, or certification.
