          For Managed SOC, Incident Response, or vCISO services, contact CyberPro directly.
        </div>
        <div class="report-footer-brand">
          <div class="rfb-name">CYBERPRO</div>
          <div class="rfb-url">cyber-pro.co.za</div>
          <div class="rfb-copy">© ${new Date().getFullYear()} CyberPro. All rights reserved.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>`;

  setTimeout(animateBars, 200);
}
